  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><a href=\"https://ghnam0410.github.io/plant/planthangman\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://ghnam0410.github.io/plant/planthangman</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"식물과 에너지 행맨 게임\" data-og-description=\"여기를 눌러 링크를 확인하세요\" data-og-host=\"ghnam0410.github.io\" data-og-source-url=\"https://ghnam0410.github.io/plant/planthangman\" data-og-url=\"https://ghnam0410.github.io/plant/planthangman\" data-og-image=\"https://img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafe_image/cafe_meta_image_190529.png\"><a href=\"https://ghnam0410.github.io/plant/planthangman\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://ghnam0410.github.io/plant/planthangman\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"https://img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafe_image/cafe_meta_image_190529.png\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">식물과 에너지 행맨 게임</p><p class=\"og-desc\">여기를 눌러 링크를 확인하세요</p><p class=\"og-host\">ghnam0410.github.io</p></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7eb9696a56bb35af3dd7fc55d88c31d18ac579b7\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7eb9696a56bb35af3dd7fc55d88c31d18ac579b7\" data-origin-width=\"1080\" data-origin-height=\"2124\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">아이들이 알파벳을 외치면 제가 눌러주는 식으로 집단지성을 활용했습니다.<br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/abc6d40101d5398822c59c3889a36d939952984e\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/abc6d40101d5398822c59c3889a36d939952984e\" data-origin-width=\"1080\" data-origin-height=\"2124\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">이런식으로 잘못된 글자를 입력할때마다 상단의 나뭇잎 개수가 줄어들면서 꽃이 점점 시들고<br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5c803d73658d655b4e13fd58e7053cf7a4cd749d\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5c803d73658d655b4e13fd58e7053cf7a4cd749d\" data-origin-width=\"1080\" data-origin-height=\"2124\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">진짜 고사하기 직전 모습이네요</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5d7f5a900f9b287f2297b6c1d4913e7029936ee9\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5d7f5a900f9b287f2297b6c1d4913e7029936ee9\" data-origin-width=\"1079\" data-origin-height=\"1969\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/665900a4e06eaaaf850d313d767a89782899482c\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/665900a4e06eaaaf850d313d767a89782899482c\" data-origin-width=\"1080\" data-origin-height=\"2124\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">하지만 결국 정답을 맞히면 꽃이 다시 살아납니다.<br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f70d50dde04d77b8e4ddfcb37dc715d43898b58b\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f70d50dde04d77b8e4ddfcb37dc715d43898b58b\" data-origin-width=\"1080\" data-origin-height=\"1962\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">게임 오버가 되면 시든 꽃 그림이 나옵니다.<br><br>뒤로 갈수록 어려운 단어가 많아서 집단지성 활용이 필수적이지만 첫시간에 시켜보니 학생들이 재미있게 참여하드라구요. 수업시간 20분 정도 시간 때우기로는 강추합니다!<br><br>애들 반응이 좋아서 동물과 에너지도 해볼까 했는데 동물과 에너지 단원은 영단어들 난이도가 매우 높네요ㅜ</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
